From: lavachemist <48248311+lavachemist@users.noreply.github.com>
Subject: [PATCH] drm/panel: xm91080g: send the four init writes the Odin 2 Mini's stock firmware sends

The AYN Odin 2 Mini's stock DT (odin2_mini 2024-06-26, overlay "KalamaP HDK")
sends 76 commands in its panel on-sequence. ROCKNIX's driver sends the same
commands byte for byte except four, which it leaves out after the first b6
block:

  00 b0 / b6 07 8c 08 0c / 00 c1 / b2 01

Add them in the stock position. Reset, delays and timings already match.
Untested on hardware (no Mini).

--- a/drivers/gpu/drm/panel/panel-boe-xm91080g.c
+++ b/drivers/gpu/drm/panel/panel-boe-xm91080g.c
@@ -82,6 +82,11 @@
 	mipi_dsi_generic_write_seq_multi(&dsi_ctx, 0xb6,
 					 0x83, 0x02, 0x00, 0x00, 0x82, 0x02,
 					 0x00, 0x00);
+	mipi_dsi_generic_write_seq_multi(&dsi_ctx, 0x00, 0xb0);
+	mipi_dsi_generic_write_seq_multi(&dsi_ctx, 0xb6,
+					 0x07, 0x8c, 0x08, 0x0c);
+	mipi_dsi_generic_write_seq_multi(&dsi_ctx, 0x00, 0xc1);
+	mipi_dsi_generic_write_seq_multi(&dsi_ctx, 0xb2, 0x01);
 	mipi_dsi_generic_write_seq_multi(&dsi_ctx, 0x00, 0x80);
 	mipi_dsi_generic_write_seq_multi(&dsi_ctx, 0xbc,
 					 0x00, 0x00, 0x0e, 0x26, 0x25, 0x02,
